WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.472
After the Transformer stack, the model has a context-aware hidden state for the current position.

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:13.322
It projects that vector into one raw score for every token in the vocabulary.

00:00:13.322 --> 00:00:15.787
Those raw scores are called log its.

00:00:15.787 --> 00:00:23.892
The example bars show that “today” has a higher log it than “before,” “and,” or “late.” The exact numbers are only

00:00:23.892 --> 00:00:31.266
illustrative. The important point is that log its are scores, not probabilities yet.
